<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?><p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Notes body"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="685800" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="5486400" cy="7315200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" rIns="0" tIns="0" bIns="0" anchor="t"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">This matrix computes the actual D01 evidence prefix, not hypothetical model outcomes. With two unsafe independent roots and zero safe, batch/context/source d=0.25. R never propagates. C uses contributor/context history, so both File batches receive 0.25. M takes max(batch,context,source) for every candidate and also applies 0.25 in this contributor’s Email context. S activates only Batch A, because the two findings have not spanned batches; its other File batch and Email receive zero. Other contributors receive no penalty in every arm. Permissions, original authority and exact local findings are common prerequisites; exact safe-use exceptions are excluded from this matrix. Shared adjusted_score=original_cosine−0.5*d, hard gate inclusive at d&gt;=0.25. One unsafe yields d=1/6 and score loss 1/12 without a hard gate. A context requires two unsafe roots spanning two batches. Global support requires four, two per each of two contexts, spanning both batches in each. These thresholds are heuristics rather than calibrated probability tests.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve"></a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">SOURCES</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- src/ams/research/dynamic/policies.py</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- src/ams/research/dynamic/ledger.py</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr algn="l"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="105000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="300"/></a:spcAft><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1200" b="0" i="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="222B31"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial"/><a:ea typeface="Arial"/><a:cs typeface="Arial"/></a:rPr><a:t xml:space="preserve">- research_data/provisional_extension_freeze_v1_20261101/private/ep_43547fc840a2c88dacd18bd7.json</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1200"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:notes>